              <div style="margin-top:6pt; text-align:justify;">
                <span style="letter-spacing:-0.068pt;">The Report of the Compensation Committee is included on </span><span style="letter-spacing:-0.0675pt;"><a href="#ROTC">page31</a></span><span style="letter-spacing:-0.068pt;"> of this proxy statement.</span>
              </div>
              <div style="margin-top:6pt; text-align:justify;">
                <span style="letter-spacing:-0.068pt;">The Compensation Committee operates under a written charter, a copy of which is available on our website at </span><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">www.hurco.com/investors</span> <span style="letter-spacing:-0.068pt;">under &#8220;Corporate Governance.&#8221;</span></div>
            </td>
